## 1. Overview

AccessBuddy manages physical access credentials (fobs, wristbands, codes) for clubs. It handles the full lifecycle from member request through approval, programming, and issuing, with integration to external access control systems like Integriti Inner Range.

### 1.1 Personas

| Persona | Description | Key Permissions |
|---------|-------------|-----------------|
| **Member** | Submits requests and manages their own credentials | Self-service: submit, report lost/damaged, request exemption |
| **Approver** | Reviews and approves/rejects requests and exemptions | `approve`, `approve_exemption` |
| **Programmer** | Programs fobs in the access control system and confirms deactivations | `program` |
| **Issuer** | Sets pickup locations and hands fobs to members | `issue` |
| **Admin** | Configures the tenant, manages members, handles refunds and reopens | `manual_add`, `cancel`, `reopen`, `renew`, `configure`, `manage_admins`, `refund` |
| **Club Admin** | Has all permissions within their club automatically | All within tenant |
| **Global Admin** | Has all permissions across all clubs | All across platform |
| **System** | Automated processes (daily cron, webhooks, auto-approval) | N/A |

> **Note:** A single person can hold multiple roles. Permissions are additive.

