## 4. Payment and Exemptions

### 4.1 Payment Determination

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Request submitted] --> B{Request type in exempt list?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Exempt - exempt by type]
    B -->|No| D{Request type = NEW?}
    D -->|Yes| E{Membership category in exempt list?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Exempt - category exempt for new fobs]
    E -->|No| G{Type requires payment?}
    D -->|No| G
    G -->|No - return/change_type/access_update| H[No payment]
    G -->|Yes - new/lost/damaged/additional| I{Credential price > $0?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Payment required]
    I -->|No| K[No payment - free credential]

    style C fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style F fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style H fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style K fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style J fill:#3b82f6,color:#fff
```

**Key details:**
- **Category exemption only applies to NEW requests.** Replacements (lost, damaged) and additional fobs always require payment regardless of membership category.
- **Request type exemption applies to all of that type** (e.g. if "return" is exempt, all returns are exempt)
- Configured per tenant in `paymentExemptRequestTypes` and `paymentExemptMembershipCategories`

