```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Request at non-final state] --> B[Admin: Click 'Hold']
    B --> C[Enter reason]
    C --> D[Save previousState + reason]
    D --> E[ON_HOLD]
    E --> F[Email: On hold]
    E --> G[Admin: Click 'Resume']
