### 8.2 Officer/Board Permission Expiry

**What it does:** When an officer or board member's term expires, their permissions are removed, their access level is recalculated, and their credentials are flagged for reprogramming in Integriti.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Daily cron] --> B[Find memberships with expired officer/board dates]
    B --> C[Clear isOfficer/isBoardMember flags]
