### 8.5 Expiry Warnings

Sends warning emails at exactly 30 days and 7 days before credential expiry.

---

### 8.6 Daily Summary Emails

Collects all queued notifications (for users with `daily_summary` frequency preference), groups by recipient, and sends one consolidated email per admin.

