## 9. Notifications

Notifications go to two audiences: members (about their own requests) and admins (about work that needs attention).

**Default frequency:** `DAILY_SUMMARY` for all notifications. Users can change to `REALTIME` or `OFF` per notification type.

**Time-critical notifications:** Only `CREDENTIAL_LOST` bypasses user preferences and always sends in realtime. All other notifications can be disabled or deferred to daily summary.

**Permission-scoped notifications:** The notifications preference page only shows notification types relevant to the admin's permissions. A programmer sees "Programming" section; an approver sees "Payments" section; etc.

