## 11. Developer Reference

### 11.1 Data Model

#### Core Tables

**`tenants`** - one per club
- `id`, `name`, `slug`, `settings` (jsonb), `timezone`, `logoUrl`, `stripeAccountId`

**`users`** - NOT tenant-scoped (users can belong to multiple clubs)
- `id`, `firebaseUid`, `email`, `firstName`, `lastName`, `phone`, `dateOfBirth`

**`tenant_memberships`** - user membership per tenant
- `userId`, `tenantId`, `membershipCategory`, `membershipNumber`
- `isOfficer`, `isBoardMember`, `isStaff` (with expiry dates)
- `accessLevelId` ← **access level lives here, not on credentials**
- `currentSeason`, `status` (active/inactive)

**`credentials`** - physical fobs/wristbands/cards
- `tenantId`, `ownerId`, `credentialTypeId`, `requestId`
- `serialNumber`, `status` (active/lost/damaged/inactive_lost/inactive_damaged/deactivated/expired/returned/pending_programming)
- `issuedAt`, `expiresAt`, `accessStartsAt`
- `deactivatedAt`, `deactivatedBy`, `deactivationReason`, `lostReportedAt`
- `programmingRequired`, `programmingReason`, `programmingRequestedAt`
- **Unique constraint:** `(tenantId, credentialTypeId, serialNumber)` - same serial allowed across types

**`fob_requests`** - workflow records
- `tenantId`, `requesterId`, `credentialTypeId`, `accessLevelId`, `pickupLocationId`
- `status`, `requestType`, `replacesCredentialId`, `relatedRequestId`
- `paymentExempt`, `paymentAmountCents`, `stripePaymentIntentId`
- Orphan fields: `isOrphaned`, `orphanEmail`, `orphanFirstName`, `orphanLastName`, `orphanDateOfBirth`
- Exemption fields: `exemptionRequested`, `exemptionReason`, `exemptionReviewedBy`, `exemptionApproved`
- Refund fields: `refundedAt`, `refundedBy`, `refundReason`, `stripeRefundId`
- Hold fields: `holdReason`, `holdPreviousStatus`
- Cancel fields: `cancelReason`, `cancelledBy`
- Timestamps: `submittedAt`, `paidAt`, `approvedAt`, `approvedBy`, `programmedAt`, `programmedBy`, `issuedAt`, `issuedBy`
- `serialNumber` (the programmed fob's serial)
- `credentialExpiresAt`, `accessUpdateReason`

**`audit_log`** - append-only history
- `entityType`, `entityId`, `action`, `fromState`, `toState`, `actorId`, `actorType`, `metadata`

**`attestation_requests`** - renewal attestations
- `userId`, `season`, `token`, `tokenExpiresAt`, `credentialResponses` (jsonb)

#### Configuration Tables

- **`credential_types`** - per-tenant credential types (Key Fob, Wristband, etc.)
- **`access_levels`** - per-tenant access levels with `externalGroupId` for Integriti
- **`user_group_rules`** - rules that match membership conditions to access levels
- **`pickup_locations`** - per-tenant pickup locations
- **`admin_assignments`** - who has what permissions in which tenant

