### 11.2 State Transition Reference

#### Request Events and Transitions

| Event | From | To | Who | Notes |
|-------|------|-----|-----|-------|
| (create) | - | SUBMITTED | Anyone | Initial state |
| PAYMENT_RECEIVED | SUBMITTED, AWAITING_PAYMENT | AWAITING_APPROVAL | System (webhook) | Stripe webhook |
| REQUEST_EXEMPTION | SUBMITTED, AWAITING_PAYMENT | AWAITING_EXEMPTION_REVIEW | Member | Inline on payment form |
| APPROVE_EXEMPTION | AWAITING_EXEMPTION_REVIEW | AWAITING_APPROVAL | `approve_exemption` | |
| REJECT_EXEMPTION | AWAITING_EXEMPTION_REVIEW | AWAITING_PAYMENT | `approve_exemption` | Creates payment link |
| PAYMENT_REQUIRED | SUBMITTED, AWAITING_APPROVAL | AWAITING_PAYMENT | `approve_exemption` (admin) or System (nightly abandoned-payment sweep) | Creates intent if missing, emails pay + signed cancel link |
| (resend payment link) | SUBMITTED, AWAITING_PAYMENT | unchanged | `approve_exemption` | Re-emails pay + cancel link; audited as `payment_link_resent` |
| CANCEL (by link) | SUBMITTED, AWAITING_PAYMENT, AWAITING_EXEMPTION_REVIEW | CANCELLED | Member via signed token in email | No sign-in; voids the Stripe intent |
| APPROVE | AWAITING_APPROVAL | AWAITING_PROGRAMMING | `approve` | Sets access level, flags, expiry |
| REJECT | AWAITING_APPROVAL | REJECTED | `approve` | Auto-refunds if paid |
| PROGRAM | AWAITING_PROGRAMMING | PROGRAMMED (or ISSUED for deactivations) | `program` | Records serial |
| SET_PICKUP | PROGRAMMED | AWAITING_PICKUP | `issue` | Often auto-chained from PROGRAM |
| ISSUE | AWAITING_PICKUP | ISSUED | `issue` | Creates credential (except for deactivations/access_update) |
| HOLD | any non-final | ON_HOLD | `approve`/`program`/`issue` | Saves previous state |
| RESUME | ON_HOLD | previous state | `approve`/`program`/`issue` | Restores saved state |
| CANCEL | any non-final | CANCELLED | `cancel` | Auto-refunds if paid |
| REOPEN | CANCELLED, REJECTED | AWAITING_APPROVAL | `reopen` | New permission |

#### Credential State Transitions

| Event | From | To | Trigger |
|-------|------|-----|---------|
| (create) | - | PENDING_PROGRAMMING or ACTIVE | Manual add / request issue |
| Activate | PENDING_PROGRAMMING | ACTIVE | Request ISSUE |
| Report Lost | ACTIVE | LOST | Member submit or report-lost endpoint |
| Report Damaged | ACTIVE | DAMAGED | Member submit or report-damaged endpoint |
| Confirm Deactivation (Lost) | LOST | INACTIVE_LOST | PROGRAM event on deactivation request |
| Confirm Deactivation (Damaged) | DAMAGED | INACTIVE_DAMAGED | PROGRAM event on deactivation request |
| Revoke | ACTIVE | DEACTIVATED | Admin revoke action |
| Swap (deactivate) | ACTIVE | DEACTIVATED | Swap PROGRAM completes |
| Reallocate | DEACTIVATED, RETURNED | ACTIVE | Manual add with existing serial |
| Expire | ACTIVE | EXPIRED | Daily cron |
| Return | ACTIVE | RETURNED | Return request ISSUE |

