## Appendix: Things to Remember

- **Access level lives on the membership**, not the credential
- **Credentials can have the same serial across types** (unique on tenant + type + serial)
- **Deactivation requests skip pickup/issue** - just confirm and done
- **Category exemptions only apply to new fobs** - not replacements
- **`AWAITING_PAYMENT` is only reached via exemption rejection** - initial payment stays at `SUBMITTED`
- **Reopen is a separate permission** from cancel/approve
- **Two-stage deactivation** - Reported Lost → Inactive - Lost (same for damaged)
- **Daily summary is the default** notification frequency
- **`CREDENTIAL_LOST` is the only** time-critical notification
- **Credential #3 lost ≠ Credential #3 damaged** - but you can have both if they're different types
